OL,3,GNEWSASevere delays for rush-hour
OL,4,Acommuters as London Underground strike
OL,5,Aenters second day
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe strike "makes life really
OL,8,Fcomplicated and stressful", Marie says
OL,9,Ffrom Finsbury Park, where she is
OL,10,Fstruggling to get a bus with her guinea
OL,11,Fpigs
OL,13,FThe Elizabeth line, DLR, London
OL,14,FOverground, buses and trams are running
OL,15,Fas normal but may be busier
